SUMMARY:Film Fest Petaluma 2026
DESCRIPTION:Now in its 18th year\, Film Fest Petaluma is a day-long showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation. Programs will take place at 12\, 3\, 7\, & 9:45. A discounted all-day pass is available for $50. A complete line-up of shorts will be available at FilmFestPetaluma.com in early April. \nHere are the planned shows and tickets: \nFILM FEST PETALUMA \nALL-DAY SHORTS PASS $50 \nAdmission to all four programs \nA showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation \nVisit FilmFestPetaluma.com for detailed program information \nFILM FEST PETALUMA \nMATINEE SHORTS $15 \nDoors 11:30am\, Show 12:00pm \n14 and over \nA showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation \nVisit FilmFestPetaluma.com for detailed program information \nFILM FEST PETALUMA \nAFTERNOON SHORTS $15 \nDoors 2:30pm\, Show 3:00pm \n14 and over \nA showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation \nVisit FilmFestPetaluma.com for detailed program information \nFILM FEST PETALUMA \nEVENING SHORTS SHOWCASE $18 \nDoors 6:30pm\, Show 7:00pm \n14 and over \nA showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation \nVisit FilmFestPetaluma.com for detailed program information \nFILM FEST PETALUMA \nLATE NIGHT SHORTS $15 \nDoors 9:30pm\, Show 9:45pm \n17 and over \nA showcase of animated and live action short films with filmmakers in conversation \nVisit FilmFestPetaluma.com for detailed program information \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/film-fest-petaluma-2026/
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall\, 23 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Film
