SUMMARY:Spring Fling Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Step into the Spring Fling Dance Party! The Zig Zag Band will set the tone with upbeat\, feel‑good music that keeps the room lively and the dance floor full. It’s the perfect way to shake off winter and welcome the season with friends\, color\, and movement. \nPremium wine and beer will be available for just $7\, and The Butcherman food truck will be serving fresh\, flavorful bites throughout the evening. Whether you arrive in your favorite spring hues\, bring a group of friends\, or simply come ready to enjoy a joyful night out\, you’ll be swept into a bright\, welcoming atmosphere that celebrates community. \nIt’s an evening of dancing\, laughter\, and connection\, Sonoma‑style. Tickets are limited\, so grab yours now and get ready to kick off spring in full swing.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spring-fling-dance-party/
LOCATION:Vintage House\, 264 1st Street East\, Sonoma\, 95476
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
