SUMMARY:Mendocino Dance Project - Surface Tension
DESCRIPTION:Mendocino Dance Project’s newest work in theaters uses contemporary dance to express the times we are currently living. It is a challenge to remain grounded and stay in touch with our own humanity as we are constantly confronted by so much turbulence in the world. Surface Tension explores how we find each other and stay resilient amongst the chaos.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/mendocino-dance-project-surface-tension/
