SUMMARY:Enfrascada presented by the Mercury Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Practical\, down-to-earth Alicia has had her heart broken and her world shattered\, but her girls\, Yesinia and Carolina\, know what to do! With Alicia’s cousin Lulu they launch into a madcap plan of magical manipulation with a little Santeria\, a dash of Hoodoo\, and a whole heap of Brujeria! \nGet ‘engrossed’ in this dark Latine comedy about friendship\, magic\, and finding yourself after your world falls apart
