SUMMARY:Volker Strifler at The California
DESCRIPTION:Bring your friends for an evening of bluesy rhythmic fun with celebrated guitarist/songwriter Volker Strifler.\nGuitarist\, songwriter and singer Volker Strifler creates music that starts with his strong blues roots and explores the rhythms of rock\, jazz and Latin music. Volker has toured around the US and Europe with the Ford Blues Band and released multiple solo albums\, including his latest\, “Let the Music Rise\,” which highlights his unique musical style and sound. \nTICKETS: \nPURCHASE IN ADVANCE AND SAVE!\nZones A & B ensure a seat. Zone C has limited seating\, plus standing room. \nZone A $27\nZone B $20\nZone C $17 (does not guarantee seating)\nTickets at the door $27 (Zone C only) \nDoors open 6:30pm. \nOur kitchen serves our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission. (Kitchen available only at events with 60 or more advance tickets sold)\nShow Less
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/volker-strifler-at-the-california/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
