SUMMARY:Spring Farm Trails - Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Bees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth Farm will be open Saturday\, May 2 and Sunday May 3 from 10 am to 4 p\,m to explore.\nBeesNBlooms is an organic certified farm with a lavender labyrinth\, butterfly garden\, ducks\, geese and chickens\, a nursery with many lavender varieties\, pollinator plants & garden starts and a farm stand with Lavender products.\n3 guided tour options will also be available:\nBuzz About Bees Tour\, Saturday May 2 & Sunday May 3 at 11 am;\nLavender Growing and Processing Tour\, Saturday May 2 & Sunday May 3 at 1 pm; AND\nOur Feathered Friends Tour\, Saturday May 2 & Sunday May 3 at 11 am.\nAdmission to the farm is free and guided tours are $5 per person (including children)\nBees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spring-farm-trails-bees-n-blooms-2/
