SUMMARY:Brunch on the Bridge 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the inaugural Brunch on the Bridge\, a one-of-a-kind community brunch celebrating the incredible food\, people\, and spirit of the Russian River. For one morning this Spring\, the historic Guerneville Bridge becomes a gathering place where locals and visitors can stroll\, mingle\, and enjoy bites from some of the region’s favorite restaurants. From sweet to savory\, each station offers a taste of what makes our local food scene so special. Grab a plate\, find a seat or a sunny spot to stand and chat\, and enjoy a relaxed brunch with friends\, neighbors\, and new faces with the Russian River flowing just below. Because around here\, brunch is better when the whole community is invited. \nThe Bottomless Bruncher (full access to food stations + bottomless mimosas & wine) $75 \nThe Hungry Bruncher (full access to all food stations\, excludes alcohol) $50 \nA Taste of the River (includes 4 tickets to sample bites from participating restaurants\, excludes alcohol\, limited availability) $25
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/brunch-on-the-bridge-2026/
LOCATION:Russian River Chamber of Commerce\, 16209 First St\, Guerneville\, 95446
CATEGORIES:Festival,Kids and Family,Other
END:VEVENT
