SUMMARY:Mercy's Bingo Smokeout
DESCRIPTION:Numbers. Prizes. Elevated Vibes. \nEvery other Sunday from 12PM – 6PM\, step into a high-energy twist on a classic favorite inside The Lounge at Mercy. \nThis isn’t your average bingo. This is bingo-elevated. \nCards in hand. Smoke in the air. Energy in the room. \nPlay through multiple bingo rounds throughout the day\, compete\, and stay locked into an experience that blends cannabis culture with interactive gameplay from start to finish. \nYour ticket includes access to all bingo sessions\, brand tastings\, exclusive product drops\, and additional games and activations happening across the space. \nOne game. All day. Let the numbers hit. \nThis is a 420-friendly interactive experience hosted inside our fully licensed cannabis consumption lounge\, where guests can enjoy responsibly while participating in gameplay\, tastings\, and activations. Bingo hits different here. \nDate and Time\nDate: Every Other Sunday\nTime: 12:00 PM – 6:00 PM \nTickets:\n$25 – General Admission: Entry to Bingo Smokeout Includes access to all bingo rounds and brand tastings. \n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC \nURLs:\nTickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3611849-0?pid=5514\nWebsite: https://go.evvnt.com/3611849-2?pid=5514\nInstagram: https://go.evvnt.com/3611849-3?pid=5514 \nDate and Time: On Sun\, 03 May 2026 12:00 – Sun\, 03 May 2026 18:00 \nVenue Details: The Lounge at Mercy\, 7950 Redwood Drive\, Cotati\, California\, 94931\, United States \nCategory: Community | Bingo \nPrice:\nGeneral Admission: USD 25.00
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/mercys-bingo-smokeout/
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy\, 7950 Redwood Drive\, Cotati\, CA\, 94931
GEO:38.33308;-122.71387
