SUMMARY:Labyrinth Walk
DESCRIPTION:An ancient prayer and meditation tool that relates to wholeness\, the labyrinth combines the imagery of the circle and the spiral into a meandering but purposeful path\, representing a journey to our own center and back again out into the world. \nJoin us as we walk in honor of World Labyrinth Day (note: this event takes place on Sunday\, May 3). \nThere will be a brief talk and orientation at 12:30 p.m. followed by a facilitated walk. The labyrinth will be open till 3:00 p.m. All are welcome. \nUnity of Santa Rosa is located in a business park across from and slightly north of Larkfield Center. There is ample parking.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/labyrinth-walk/
LOCATION:Unity of Santa Rosa\, 4857 Old Redwood Hwy\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
