SUMMARY:Joy of Astonishment - An Afternoon of Magic and Mentalism
DESCRIPTION:An unforgettable adventure that defies your understanding of what’s possible – leaving you questioning everything you thought you knew.\net ready to experience the impossible with magician and mentalist Robert Goleman in his premiere engagement at The California Theatre on Sunday\, May 3 at 1:00 pm. \nAudiences and critics alike have hailed Goleman’s performances as “nothing short of astonishing”. \nIn an age where digital personalities dominate and viral content shapes trends\, Robert Goleman has remained absent from social media for more than a decade. Offering theater goers something refreshingly different – a performance shrouded in mystery that can only be experienced in person. \n“Live theater is about connection\, presence\, and the thrill of the unexpected\,” says Goleman. “Each show is a singular event\, crafted to engage and astonish every audience member.” As the performance unfolds\, you’ll find yourself captivated not only by Robert’s remarkable skill\, but also by the tangible connection he establishes with his guests. Every demonstration is performed with a masterful touch that blends suspense\, humor\, and genuine engagement\, making every moment feel personal. \nZone A $35\nZone B $28\nZone C $21 (does not guarantee seating).\nTickets at the door $35 (Zone C only) \nDoors open 12:00pm. \nOur kitchen serves our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission. (Kitchen available only at events with 60 or more advance tickets sold)
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/joy-of-astonishment-an-afternoon-of-magic-and-mentalism/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Joy-of-Astonishment.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
